# ML — typed machine-learning library (umbrella).
#
# Opens the core (types, dataset ops, metrics, prediction) and every
# estimator family, so ``open ML`` brings the whole API into scope
# exactly as before. For a smaller footprint, open a single family
# instead — e.g. ``open MLTrees`` or ``open MLLinear`` —
# which transitively opens ``MLCore``.

open MLCore